</section><section data-mw-section-id="31" id="mwAcM" aria-labelledby="Version_history"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="Version_history">Version history</h2></div>
<table class="wikitable" id="mwAcQ">
<caption id="mwAcU"></caption>
<tbody id="mwAcY"><tr id="mwAcc"><th id="mwAcg">Version</th>
<th id="mwAck">Build</th>
<th id="mwAco">Codename</th>
<th id="mwAcs">Release date</th>
<th id="mwAcw">Notes</th></tr>
<tr id="mwAc0">
<td style="text-align: center;" id="mwAc4">6.0</td>
<td id="mwAc8">10A402<br id="mwAdA"/>10A403<br id="mwAdE"/>10A405<sup about="#mwt188" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-iphone5_53-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Transclusion mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"iphone5","group":"lower-alpha"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-iphone5-53"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"efn","href":"./Template:Efn"},"params":{"name":{"wt":"iphone5"},"1":{"wt":"[[iPhone 5]] only"}},"i":0}}]}'><a href="#cite_note-iphone5-53" data-mw-group="lower-alpha" id="mwAdI"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAdM"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAdQ">[</span>a<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAdU">]</span></span></a></sup><br id="mwAdY"/>10A406<sup about="#mwt191" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-54" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Transclusion mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"group":"lower-alpha"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-54"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"efn","href":"./Template:Efn"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"[[iPad Mini (1st generation)|iPad mini (1st generation)]] and [[iPod Touch (5th generation)]] only"}},"i":0}}]}'><a href="#cite_note-54" data-mw-group="lower-alpha" id="mwAdc"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAdg"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAdk">[</span>b<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAdo">]</span></span></a></sup><br id="mwAds"/>10A407<sup about="#mwt194" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-55" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Transclusion mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"group":"lower-alpha"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-55"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"efn","href":"./Template:Efn"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"[[iPad (4th generation)]] only"}},"i":0}}]}'><a href="#cite_note-55" data-mw-group="lower-alpha" id="mwAdw"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAd0"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAd4">[</span>c<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAd8">]</span></span></a></sup></td>
<td rowspan="3" id="mwAeA">Sundance</td>
<td id="mwAeE">August 27, 2012<br id="mwAeI"/>September 19, 2012<br id="mwAeM"/>September 21, 2012<br id="mwAeQ"/>October 11, 2012<br id="mwAeU"/>November 2, 2012</td>
<td id="mwAeY">Initial release on iPhone 5, iPod touch (5th generation), iPad mini (1st generation), and iPad (4th generation)
<ul id="mwAec"><li id="mwAeg">Introduces Apple Maps, to replace Google Maps.</li>
<li id="mwAek">Siri can now tell you sport related information.</li>
<li id="mwAeo">Facebook has now been integrated into Settings.</li>
<li id="mwAes">FaceTime calls can now be done over cellular data on iPhone 4S, iPhone 5, and iPad 3 (Wi-Fi + Cellular).</li>
<li id="mwAew">Do Not Disturb can be activated to suppress incoming calls and notifications.</li>
<li id="mwAe0">Adds a Reply with Message feature if a call is declined.</li>
<li id="mwAe4">Adds the Clock app to the iPad.</li>
<li id="mwAe8">Custom vibrations can be set for alerts on iPhone.</li>
<li id="mwAfA">Fixes a bug that allows a local attacker to learn what third-party app was in use before the device was locked.</li>
<li id="mwAfE">Fixes bugs that allowed a local attacker to bypass a device locked with a passcode.</li>
<li id="mwAfI">Fixes a bug that allowed a local attacker to initiate a FaceTime call on a locked device.</li>
<li id="mwAfM">Fixes a bug that allowed users to make purchases without inputting Apple ID credentials.</li>
<li id="mwAfQ">Fixes a bug that caused SMS messages to disrupt cellular connectivity.</li></ul></td></tr>
<tr id="mwAfU">
<td style="text-align: center;" id="mwAfY">6.0.1</td>
<td id="mwAfc">10A523<br id="mwAfg"/>10A525<sup about="#mwt197" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-iphone5_53-1" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Transclusion mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"iphone5","group":"lower-alpha"},"body":{"html":""},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"efn","href":"./Template:Efn"},"params":{"name":{"wt":"iphone5"}},"i":0}}]}'><a href="#cite_note-iphone5-53" data-mw-group="lower-alpha" id="mwAfk"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAfo"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAfs">[</span>a<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAfw">]</span></span></a></sup><br id="mwAf0"/>10A8426<sup about="#mwt200" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-56" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Transclusion mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"group":"lower-alpha"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-56"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"efn","href":"./Template:Efn"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"iPad (4th generation) (Wi-Fi + Cellular) and iPad mini (1st generation) (Wi-Fi + Cellular) only"}},"i":0}}]}'><a href="#cite_note-56" data-mw-group="lower-alpha" id="mwAf4"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAf8"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAgA">[</span>d<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAgE">]</span></span></a></sup></td>
<td id="mwAgI">October 29, 2012</td>
<td id="mwAgM">
<ul id="mwAgQ"><li id="mwAgU">Fixes a bug that prevented iPhone 5 from installing updates wirelessly.</li>
<li id="mwAgY">Fixes a bug that prevented camera flash from activating.</li>
<li id="mwAgc">Fixes a bug that prevented cellular connectivity from being available.</li>
<li id="mwAgg">Fixes a bug that allowed a maliciously crafted website to execute arbitrary code<sup about="#mwt205" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-57" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-57"}}'><a href="#cite_note-57" id="mwAgk"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAgo"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAgs">[</span>53<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAgw">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt208" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-58" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-58"}}'><a href="#cite_note-58" id="mwAg0"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAg4"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAg8">[</span>54<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAhA">]</span></span></a></sup></li></ul></td></tr>
<tr id="mwAhE">
<td style="text-align: center;" id="mwAhI">6.0.2</td>
<td id="mwAhM">10A550<sup about="#mwt209" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-59" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Transclusion mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"group":"lower-alpha"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-59"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"efn","href":"./Template:Efn"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"iPad mini (1st generation) (Wi-Fi) only"}},"i":0}}]}'><a href="#cite_note-59" data-mw-group="lower-alpha" id="mwAhQ"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAhU"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAhY">[</span>e<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAhc">]</span></span></a></sup><br id="mwAhg"/>10A551<sup about="#mwt212" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-iphone5_53-2" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Transclusion mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"iphone5","group":"lower-alpha"},"body":{"html":""},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"efn","href":"./Template:Efn"},"params":{"name":{"wt":"iphone5"}},"i":0}}]}'><a href="#cite_note-iphone5-53" data-mw-group="lower-alpha" id="mwAhk"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAho"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAhs">[</span>a<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAhw">]</span></span></a></sup><br id="mwAh0"/>10A8500<sup about="#mwt215" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-ipadmini1cell_60-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Transclusion mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"ipadmini1cell","group":"lower-alpha"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-ipadmini1cell-60"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"efn","href":"./Template:Efn"},"params":{"name":{"wt":"ipadmini1cell"},"1":{"wt":"iPad mini (1st generation) (Wi-Fi + Cellular) only"}},"i":0}}]}'><a href="#cite_note-ipadmini1cell-60" data-mw-group="lower-alpha" id="mwAh4"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAh8"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAiA">[</span>f<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAiE">]</span></span></a></sup></td>
<td id="mwAiI">December 13, 2012</td>
<td id="mwAiM"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/IPhone_5" title="IPhone 5" id="mwAiQ">iPhone 5</a> and <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/IPad_Mini_(1st_generation)" title="IPad Mini (1st generation)" id="mwAiU">iPad mini (1st generation)</a> only

<ul id="mwAiY"><li id="mwAic">Fixes a bug that prevented Wi-Fi from working<sup about="#mwt220" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-61" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-61"}}'><a href="#cite_note-61" id="mwAig"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAik"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAio">[</span>55<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAis">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt223" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-62" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-62"}}'><a href="#cite_note-62" id="mwAiw"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAi0"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAi4">[</span>56<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAi8">]</span></span></a></sup></li></ul></td></tr>
<tr id="mwAjA">
<td style="text-align: center;" id="mwAjE">6.1</td>
<td id="mwAjI">10B137<br id="mwAjM"/>10B141<br id="mwAjQ"/>10B142<sup about="#mwt224" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-iphone4s_63-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Transclusion mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"iphone4s","group":"lower-alpha"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-iphone4s-63"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"efn","href":"./Template:Efn"},"params":{"name":{"wt":"iphone4s"},"1":{"wt":"[[iPhone 4S]] only"}},"i":0}}]}'><a href="#cite_note-iphone4s-63" data-mw-group="lower-alpha" id="mwAjU"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAjY"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAjc">[</span>g<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAjg">]</span></span></a></sup><br id="mwAjk"/>10B143<sup about="#mwt227" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-iphone5_53-3" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Transclusion mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"iphone5","group":"lower-alpha"},"body":{"html":""},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"efn","href":"./Template:Efn"},"params":{"name":{"wt":"iphone5"}},"i":0}}]}'><a href="#cite_note-iphone5-53" data-mw-group="lower-alpha" id="mwAjo"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAjs"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAjw">[</span>a<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAj0">]</span></span></a></sup><br id="mwAj4"/>10B144<sup about="#mwt230" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-64" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Transclusion mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"group":"lower-alpha"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-64"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"efn","href":"./Template:Efn"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"[[iPhone 4]] (GSM) and [[iPod Touch (4th generation)]] only"}},"i":0}}]}'><a href="#cite_note-64" data-mw-group="lower-alpha" id="mwAj8"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAkA"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAkE">[</span>h<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAkI">]</span></span></a></sup></td>
<td rowspan="3" id="mwAkM">Brighton</td>
<td id="mwAkQ">January 7, 2013<br id="mwAkU"/>January 28, 2013</td>
<td id="mwAkY">
<ul id="mwAkc"><li id="mwAkg">iOS 6.1 changed the lock screen music controls. The new controls have a more silver appearance, from its previous appearance which was more blue. Also the clock was shrunk while playing music, where in iOS 6.0 and previous versions it was still legible as normal.<sup about="#mwt235" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-65" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-65"}}'><a href="#cite_note-65" id="mwAkk"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAko"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAks">[</span>57<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAkw">]</span></span></a></sup></li>
<li id="mwAk0">Adds support for more <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/LTE_(telecommunication)" title="LTE (telecommunication)" id="mwAk4">LTE</a> cellular carriers</li>
<li id="mwAk8">Integrates <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Siri" title="Siri" id="mwAlA">Siri</a> and <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fandango_Media" title="Fandango Media" id="mwAlE">Fandango</a> to allow Siri to purchase movie tickets (U.S. only).</li>
<li id="mwAlI">Adds the Reset Advertising Identifier button in Settings.</li>
<li id="mwAlM">iTunes Match subscribers can download individual songs from iCloud.<sup about="#mwt238" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-Fandango_integration_8-2" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"Fandango integration"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-Fandango_integration-8"}}'><a href="#cite_note-Fandango_integration-8" id="mwAlQ"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAlU"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAlY">[</span>8<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAlc">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt241" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-66" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-66"}}'><a href="#cite_note-66" id="mwAlg"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAlk"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAlo">[</span>58<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAls">]</span></span></a></sup></li></ul></td></tr>
<tr id="mwAlw">
<td style="text-align: center;" id="mwAl0">6.1.1</td>
<td id="mwAl4">10B145</td>
<td id="mwAl8">February 11, 2013</td>
<td id="mwAmA">iPhone 4S only, improves cellular reliability for iPhone 4S.<sup about="#mwt244" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-67" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-67"}}'><a href="#cite_note-67" id="mwAmE"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAmI"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAmM">[</span>59<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAmQ">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt247" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-68" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-68"}}'><a href="#cite_note-68" id="mwAmU"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAmY"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAmc">[</span>60<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAmg">]</span></span></a></sup></td></tr>
<tr id="mwAmk">
<td style="text-align: center;" id="mwAmo">6.1.2</td>
<td id="mwAms">10B146<br id="mwAmw"/>10B147<sup about="#mwt248" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-ipadmini1cell_60-1" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Transclusion mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"ipadmini1cell","group":"lower-alpha"},"body":{"html":""},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"efn","href":"./Template:Efn"},"params":{"name":{"wt":"ipadmini1cell"}},"i":0}}]}'><a href="#cite_note-ipadmini1cell-60" data-mw-group="lower-alpha" id="mwAm0"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAm4"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAm8">[</span>f<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAnA">]</span></span></a></sup></td>
<td id="mwAnE">February 19, 2013</td>
<td id="mwAnI">
<ul id="mwAnM"><li id="mwAnQ">Fixes a bug in <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Microsoft_Exchange_Server" title="Microsoft Exchange Server" id="mwAnU">Exchange</a> calendar that increased network activity and reduced battery life.<sup about="#mwt253" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-69" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-69"}}'><a href="#cite_note-69" id="mwAnY"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAnc"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAng">[</span>61<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAnk">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt256" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-70" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-70"}}'><a href="#cite_note-70" id="mwAno"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAns"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAnw">[</span>62<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAn0">]</span></span></a></sup></li></ul></td></tr>
<tr id="mwAn4">
<td style="text-align: center;" id="mwAn8">6.1.3</td>
<td id="mwAoA">10B329</td>
<td id="mwAoE">BrightonMaps</td>
<td id="mwAoI">March 13, 2013</td>
<td id="mwAoM">
<ul id="mwAoQ"><li id="mwAoU">Fixes a bug that allowed a passcode lock screen bypass to access the Phone app.</li>
<li id="mwAoY">Improves the Maps app in Japan.</li>
<li id="mwAoc">Fixes a bug that allowed a user to execute unsigned code.<sup about="#mwt259" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-71" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-71"}}'><a href="#cite_note-71" id="mwAog"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAok"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAoo">[</span>63<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAos">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt262" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-72" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-72"}}'><a href="#cite_note-72" id="mwAow"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAo0"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAo4">[</span>64<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAo8">]</span></span></a></sup></li></ul></td></tr>
<tr id="mwApA">
<th colspan="5" id="mwApE">Exclusive to <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/IPhone_5" title="IPhone 5" id="mwApI">iPhone 5</a></th></tr>
<tr id="mwApM">
<td style="text-align: center;" id="mwApQ">6.1.4</td>
<td id="mwApU">10B350</td>
<td id="mwApY">BrightonMaps</td>
<td id="mwApc">April 27, 2013</td>
<td id="mwApg">Fixes a speakerphone bug for iPhone 5<sup about="#mwt265" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-73" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-73"}}'><a href="#cite_note-73" id="mwApk"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwApo"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAps">[</span>65<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwApw">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt268" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-74" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-74"}}'><a href="#cite_note-74" id="mwAp0"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAp4"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAp8">[</span>66<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAqA">]</span></span></a></sup></td></tr>
<tr id="mwAqE">
<th colspan="5" id="mwAqI">Exclusive to <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/IPod_Touch_(4th_generation)" title="IPod Touch (4th generation)" id="mwAqM">iPod touch (4th generation)</a></th></tr>
<tr id="mwAqQ">
<td style="text-align: center;" id="mwAqU">6.1.5</td>
<td id="mwAqY">10B400</td>
<td id="mwAqc">BrightonMaps</td>
<td id="mwAqg">November 14, 2013</td>
<td id="mwAqk">Fixes a bug for iPod Touch 4 that caused FaceTime calls to fail.<sup about="#mwt271" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-75" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-75"}}'><a href="#cite_note-75" id="mwAqo"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAqs"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAqw">[</span>67<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAq0">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt274" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-76" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-76"}}'><a href="#cite_note-76" id="mwAq4"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAq8"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwArA">[</span>68<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwArE">]</span></span></a></sup></td></tr>
<tr id="mwArI">
<th colspan="5" id="mwArM">Exclusive to <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/IPhone_3GS" title="IPhone 3GS" id="mwArQ">iPhone 3GS</a> and <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/IPod_Touch_(4th_generation)" title="IPod Touch (4th generation)" id="mwArU">iPod touch (4th generation)</a></th></tr>
<tr id="mwArY">
<td style="text-align: center;" id="mwArc">6.1.6</td>
<td id="mwArg">10B500</td>
<td id="mwArk">BrightonMaps</td>
<td id="mwAro">February 21, 2014</td>
<td id="mwArs">Fixes the infamous <code class="mw-highlight mw-highlight-lang-text mw-content-ltr" style="" dir="ltr" typeof="mw:Extension/syntaxhighlight mw:Transclusion" about="#mwt275" id="mwArw" data-mw='{"name":"syntaxhighlight","attrs":{"lang":"text","class":"","style":"","inline":"1"},"body":{"extsrc":"goto fail;"},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"code","href":"./Template:Code"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"goto fail;"}},"i":0}}]}'>goto fail;</code> <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Transport_Layer_Security" title="Transport Layer Security" id="mwAr0">SSL</a> verification bug.<sup about="#mwt279" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-77" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-77"}}'><a href="#cite_note-77" id="mwAr4"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAr8"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAsA">[</span>69<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAsE">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt282" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-78" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-78"}}'><a href="#cite_note-78" id="mwAsI"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAsM"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAsQ">[</span>70<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAsU">]</span></span></a></sup></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
<span class="mw-empty-elt" about="#mwt283" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAsY" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"notelist","href":"./Template:Notelist"},"params":{},"i":0}}]}'><style data-mw-deduplicate="TemplateStyles:r1327269900" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" about="#mwt284" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Reflist/styles.css"}}'>.mw-parser-output .reflist-columns-2{column-width:30em}.mw-parser-output .reflist-columns-3{column-width:25em}body.skin-vector-2022 .mw-parser-output .reflist-columns-2{column-width:27em}body.skin-vector-2022 .mw-parser-output .reflist-columns-3{column-width:22.5em}.mw-parser-output .references[data-mw-group=upper-alpha]{list-style-type:upper-alpha}.mw-parser-output .references[data-mw-group=upper-roman]{list-style-type:upper-roman}.mw-parser-output .references[data-mw-group=lower-alpha]{list-style-type:lower-alpha}.mw-parser-output .references[data-mw-group=lower-greek]{list-style-type:lower-greek}.mw-parser-output .references[data-mw-group=lower-roman]{list-style-type:lower-roman}.mw-parser-output div.reflist-liststyle-upper-alpha .references{list-style-type:upper-alpha}.mw-parser-output div.reflist-liststyle-upper-roman .references{list-style-type:upper-roman}.mw-parser-output div.reflist-liststyle-lower-alpha .references{list-style-type:lower-alpha}.mw-parser-output div.reflist-liststyle-lower-greek .references{list-style-type:lower-greek}.mw-parser-output div.reflist-liststyle-lower-roman .references{list-style-type:lower-roman}</style></span><div about="#mwt283" id="mwAsc">
<div class="mw-references-wrap" typeof="mw:Extension/references" about="#mwt285" id="mwAsg" data-mw='{"name":"references","attrs":{"group":"lower-alpha","responsive":"1"},"body":{"extsrc":""}}'><ol class="mw-references references" data-mw-group="lower-alpha" id="mwAsk"><li about="#cite_note-iphone5-53" id="cite_note-iphone5-53" data-mw-footnote-number="a"><span rel="mw:referencedBy" class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwAso"><a href="#cite_ref-iphone5_53-0" data-mw-group="lower-alpha" id="mwAss"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwAsw">1</span></a> <a href="#cite_ref-iphone5_53-1" data-mw-group="lower-alpha" id="mwAs0"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwAs4">2</span></a> <a href="#cite_ref-iphone5_53-2" data-mw-group="lower-alpha" id="mwAs8"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwAtA">3</span></a> <a href="#cite_ref-iphone5_53-3" data-mw-group="lower-alpha" id="mwAtE"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwAtI">4</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-iphone5-53" class="mw-reference-text reference-text" data-mw-group="lower-alpha"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/IPhone_5" title="IPhone 5" id="mwAtM">iPhone 5</a> only</span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-54" id="cite_note-54" data-mw-footnote-number="b"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwAtQ"><a href="#cite_ref-54" data-mw-group="lower-alpha" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwAtU"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwAtY">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-54" class="mw-reference-text reference-text" data-mw-group="lower-alpha"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/IPad_Mini_(1st_generation)" title="IPad Mini (1st generation)" id="mwAtc">iPad mini (1st generation)</a> and <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/IPod_Touch_(5th_generation)" title="IPod Touch (5th generation)" id="mwAtg">iPod Touch (5th generation)</a> only</span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-55" id="cite_note-55" data-mw-footnote-number="c"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwAtk"><a href="#cite_ref-55" data-mw-group="lower-alpha" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwAto"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwAts">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-55" class="mw-reference-text reference-text" data-mw-group="lower-alpha"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/IPad_(4th_generation)" title="IPad (4th generation)" id="mwAtw">iPad (4th generation)</a> only</span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-56" id="cite_note-56" data-mw-footnote-number="d"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwAt0"><a href="#cite_ref-56" data-mw-group="lower-alpha" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwAt4"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwAt8">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-56" class="mw-reference-text reference-text" data-mw-group="lower-alpha">iPad (4th generation) (Wi-Fi + Cellular) and iPad mini (1st generation) (Wi-Fi + Cellular) only</span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-59" id="cite_note-59" data-mw-footnote-number="e"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwAuA"><a href="#cite_ref-59" data-mw-group="lower-alpha" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwAuE"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwAuI">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-59" class="mw-reference-text reference-text" data-mw-group="lower-alpha">iPad mini (1st generation) (Wi-Fi) only</span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-ipadmini1cell-60" id="cite_note-ipadmini1cell-60" data-mw-footnote-number="f"><span rel="mw:referencedBy" class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwAuM"><a href="#cite_ref-ipadmini1cell_60-0" data-mw-group="lower-alpha" id="mwAuQ"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwAuU">1</span></a> <a href="#cite_ref-ipadmini1cell_60-1" data-mw-group="lower-alpha" id="mwAuY"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwAuc">2</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-ipadmini1cell-60" class="mw-reference-text reference-text" data-mw-group="lower-alpha">iPad mini (1st generation) (Wi-Fi + Cellular) only</span></li>
